          "text": "Acne history and triggers"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Acne for years on face and possibly upper back. Flares around menses and with makeup; sometimes sleeps in makeup. Irregular topical use and missed follow-ups."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
