          "text": "Skin examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Face and upper back with multiple open and closed comedones and scattered erythematous papules/pustules; no nodules or cysts, mild post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation, and no significant scarring."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
